<title>USA: TABLE - Boise Cascade Corp Q2 results.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Boise Cascade Corp Q2 results.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-07-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>BOISE CASCADE CORPORATION INCOME SUMMARY</p>
<p>						(unaudited)</p>
<p> Three months ended June 30    1997			   1996</p>
<p> Sales		    $1,333,010,000	     $1,261,510,000</p>
<p> Net loss		   (16,230,000)		 (16,950,000)</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p> Primary			     (.53)			  (.55)</p>
<p> Fully Diluted		     (.53)			  (.55)</p>
<p>Six Months ended June 30</p>
<p> Sales		     2,606,620,000		2,489,110,000</p>
<p> Net income (loss)	(31,440,000)		    8,560,000</p>
<p>Net loss per common share</p>
<p> Primary			    (1.04)			  (.23)</p>
<p> Fully diluted		    (1.04)			  (.23)</p>
<p>Average number of common</p>
<p>  shares outstanding	48,557,000		   48,080,000</p>
<p>NOTE: Q2 First Call mean estimate was a loss of $0.52/shr.</p>
<p>The computation of fully diluted net loss for the three and six months ended June 30, 1997 and 1996, was antidilutive; therefore, the amounts reported for primary and fully diluted loss are the same.</p>
</text>
